# For "npx expo start" / Expo Go on a real phone, "localhost" means the
# phone itself, not this computer — the API URL must be a real address the
# phone can reach. Same LAN: use this computer's IPv4 (Windows: `ipconfig`,
# look for "Endereço IPv4"). It changes if the router reassigns a DHCP
# lease, so re-check it if the app suddenly can't reach the backend.
#
# Copy this file to .env (gitignored) and fill in the real value:
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://SEU_IP_LOCAL:3001
